## Popular service integrations
Each service has a page at `https://ifttt.com/<service>` listing its Triggers, Queries, and Actions.
- [Google Sheets](https://ifttt.com/google_sheets): Append rows, log data from any Trigger source.
- [Gmail](https://ifttt.com/gmail): Send emails, filter by tags.
- [Google Calendar](https://ifttt.com/google_calendar): Create events, trigger on upcoming events.
- [Discord](https://ifttt.com/discord): Post messages to channels, trigger on server activity.
- [Spotify](https://ifttt.com/spotify): Save tracks, create playlists, trigger on new releases.
- [YouTube](https://ifttt.com/youtube): Trigger on new videos from a channel, upload or like actions.
- [X (Twitter)](https://ifttt.com/twitter): Post tweets, trigger on new tweets, mentions, or hashtags.
- [Instagram](https://ifttt.com/instagram): Trigger on new posts, cross-post photos to other services.
- [Notion](https://ifttt.com/notion): Add database items and pages from any Trigger.
- [Slack](https://ifttt.com/slack): Post messages and alerts to channels.
- [Telegram](https://ifttt.com/telegram): Send messages and files to chats and channels.
- [Reddit](https://ifttt.com/reddit): Trigger on new posts, post to subreddits.
- [GitHub](https://ifttt.com/github): Trigger on issues, commits, and pull requests.
- [Todoist](https://ifttt.com/todoist): Create tasks, trigger on task completion.
- [Dropbox](https://ifttt.com/dropbox): Save files, trigger on new files in a folder.
- [Ring](https://ifttt.com/ring): Trigger on doorbell press or motion detection.
- [SmartThings](https://ifttt.com/smartthings_v2): Control and monitor a wide range of smart home devices.
- [Webhooks](https://ifttt.com/maker_webhooks): Send and receive arbitrary HTTP requests, the universal integration bridge.
- [Oura](https://ifttt.com/oura_ring): Trigger on daily activity goals, sleep data, or readiness.

## Connect X to Y
Pairwise integration pages answer "how do I connect <A> to <B>", at `https://ifttt.com/connect/<a>/<b>`.
- Example: [Connect Instagram to Twitter](https://ifttt.com/connect/instagram/twitter)
- Full inventory: see the connect-pages sitemap below.

## Popular Applets
Representative Applets, each a Trigger to Action pairing:
- SMS to email: incoming Android text message forwards its full contents to Gmail, making texts searchable and archivable.
- Instagram to Twitter native photo: a new Instagram post is tweeted as a native image rather than a link.
- Gmail to Sheets logger: a new starred email appends sender, subject, and date to a Google Sheet.
- New music archive: a new track in a Spotify playlist is added to a permanent archive playlist.
- Doorbell alert: a Ring doorbell press sends a notification or logs the event.

